n-names>RA</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>affy--analysis of Affymetrix GeneChip data at the probe-level</article-title><source>Bioinformatics</source><year>2004</year><volume>20</volume><fpage>307</fpage><lpage>315</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">14960456</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1093/bioinformatics/btg405</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B24"><citation citation-type="other"><article-title>Cluster Analysis Software</article-title><ext-link ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="http://rana.lbl.gov/EisenSoftware.htm"/></citation></ref><ref id="B25"><citation citation-type="other"><article-title>NetAffx Analysis Center</article-title><ext-link ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="http://www.affymetrix.com/analysis/index.affx"/></citation></ref><ref id="B26"><citation citation-type="other"><article-title>DAVID</article-title><ext-link ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="http://david.abcc.ncifcrf.gov"/></citation></ref><ref id="B27"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Rozen</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Skaletsky</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Pimer3 on the WWW for general users and for biologist programmers</article-title><source>Methods Mol Biol</source><year>2000</year><volume>132</volume><fpage>365</fpage><lpage>386</lpage><ext-link ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="http://jura.wi.mit.edu/rozen/papers/rozen-and-skaletsky-2000-primer3.pdf"/><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">10547847</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B28"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Livak</surname><given-names>KJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Schmittgen</surname><given-names>TD</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Analysis of relative gene expression data using real-time quantitative PCR and the 2(_delta delta C(T)) method</article-title><source>Methods</source><year>2001</year><volume>25</volume><fpage>402</fpage><lpage>408</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11846609</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1006/meth.2001.1262</pub-id></citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>